       \"findingId\": \"find_db74f77cbd724854\",\n          \"note\": \"DB healthy; revert is sufficient.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:05.900Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"acceptedDecisions\": [],\n  \"supersededDecisions\": [],\n  \"openTasks\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:12.462Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_b0b53ba14df44875\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"title\": \"Monitor checkout 503 rate after the 09:22 pause\",\n      \"description\": \"Evidence ends at 09:24 and does not show the effect of the 09:22 rollout pause. Refresh alert/revision/pool metrics to confirm whether 503s persist and whether the incident is still open; update findings accordingly.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_d003e0d8b3924aa7\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:12.462Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:11.500Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_9ff03d1e5c7d47d6\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"title\": \"Assess checkout customer impact and possible partial-write data loss\",\n      \"description\": \"Quantify affected checkouts and determine whether failed requests could have left partial DB writes or lost orders. Only ~4503/7490 r184 checkouts succeeded per 5-min window; the evidence does not establish whether any data loss occurred, so verify directly rather than assume.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_d003e0d8b3924aa7\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:11.500Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:10.464Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_975cec3134ab492e\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"title\": \"Confirm root cause and obtain approval to halt order-api r184 / revert to r183\",\n      \"description\": \"Validate the r184 DB_POOL_MAX=4 pool-starvation root cause with the order-api owner, confirm whether the config reduction was intentional, and get explicit human approval for the proposed response (dec_55d5c756c8fb4334). Do not execute a rollback or config change without approval. Evidence is a snapshot ending 09:24.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_d003e0d8b3924aa7\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:24:10.464Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:47.274Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_1e1c3b7e3f2448e6\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"summary\": \"Uncertain: cause of the pool_max change, full r184 diff, and customer/data-loss impact are unverified\",\n      \"detail\": \"Open questions the evidence cannot settle: (1) why DB_POOL_MAX was reduced to 4 and whether that was intentional; (2) whether r184 contains code changes beyond the listed config (only configs shown); (3) how many checkouts failed after a partial DB write, i.e. whether any data loss occurred; (4) whether the 503s continue after the 09:22 pause, since evidence ends 09:24. No remediation success is assumed.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.7,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:46.067Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_fcffc5c21d444a6a\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"summary\": \"Inferred root cause: r184's undersized DB pool causes checkout timeouts returning 503\",\n      \"detail\": \"The r184 revision sets DB_POOL_MAX=4 per pod. With 2 pods carrying ~25% of checkout traffic, each pool is exhausted; requests queue (pending ~40) and wait hits the 3000ms checkout timeout, surfacing as 503. Consistent with (a) onset when r184 began taking traffic at 09:15, (b) ~40% error rate only on r184, (c) r183 unaffected, (d) healthy database with idle connections. This is an inference from correlation across the four evidence files, not a direct code-level proof.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.85,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_36fd2b53007d4e1b\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_fcffc5c21d444a6a\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_51fbc2cf77ff4878\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"Pool starvation and 3000ms waits on r184.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:53.115Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_c6335c2b02224ace\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_fcffc5c21d444a6a\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_d66f0100572d4d1c\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"DB_POOL_MAX=4 on r184.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:53.564Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_8af942c2bab84309\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_fcffc5c21d444a6a\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_aaf5bff24ea349f0\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"Error rate isolated to r184.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:54.015Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_b43cb32f76544634\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_fcffc5c21d444a6a\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_170c6ebb3932425f\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"DB healthy, ruling out backend bottlenecks.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:54.465Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:44.650Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_db74f77cbd724854\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"summary\": \"Observed: orders-primary database is healthy throughout; not the bottleneck\",\n      \"detail\": \"orders-primary: cpu 31/34/33%, query_p95 18/19/18 ms, db_errors_1m 0, available_connections 188/182/181 across 09:09, 09:16, 09:21. No DB-side errors or saturation to explain the 503s.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.9,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_9330b5a8b4d948e0\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_db74f77cbd724854\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_170c6ebb3932425f\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"DB health metrics across the incident window.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:52.685Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:43.996Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_a35ac458fd8e4ae3\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"summary\": \"Observed: r184 pods are DB-pool starved; its DB_POOL_MAX was cut from 24 to 4\",\n      \"detail\": \"r184 pods new-1/new-2: pool_max=4, in_use=4 (saturated), pending 38-44, pool_wait_p95_ms=3000 (equal to CHECKOUT_TIMEOUT_MS=3000), pool_wait_timeouts_1m=291-322. r183 old pods: pool_max=24, in_use 10-12, pending 0, pool_wait_p95 8-10ms, 0 timeouts. Config diff in 02-rollout.json: r183 DB_POOL_MAX=24 vs r184 DB_POOL_MAX=4 (all other listed config equal).\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.93,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_5651f6da4c134d79\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_a35ac458fd8e4ae3\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_51fbc2cf77ff4878\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"Pool saturation and wait timeouts on r184 pods.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:51.790Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_1f5f0a8aca614c34\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_a35ac458fd8e4ae3\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_d66f0100572d4d1c\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"Config diff DB_POOL_MAX 24 vs 4.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:52.242Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_cd56c326a91b4851\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_817ea686dcc64eea\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:23:42.861Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_71064097a1bf44da\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n      \"summary\": \"Observed: nearly all new 503s come from new revision r184; r183 stays healthy\",\n      \"detail\": \"At 09:15, r184 (2 pods, ~25% of traffic) served 7490 requests with 2987 503s (~40% error rate) and 4503 successes; r183 (6 pods) served 22490 with 91 503s (~0.4%). At 09:20 r184: 7510 req / 3061 503 / 4449 successes; r183: 22530 / 93 / 22437. Edge 503 totals match r183+r184 sums (3078=2987+91; 3154=3061+93).\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.95,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_f962d038c78a4a55\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_d046141f7f7d4391\",\n\n...21858 bytes truncated...\n\nThe tool call succeeded but the output was truncated. Full output saved to: /home/agent/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_119c1cc7a0010EY3Sxzri